      "content": "That makes sense, thanks. I'm really trying to avoid being \"all style and no substance,\" but I'm also paranoid that if I'm too subtle, the algorithm will just toss my application in the bin before a human even sees it. \n\nThe terms you mentioned—like 'epistemological' and 'paradigm shift'—are really central to my work, but I struggle to make them feel organic. Could you actually try writing a draft of that opening paragraph now? Try to find that balance where the 'high-impact' terms are present enough to satisfy the filter, but the actual research narrative feels sophisticated and deep rather than just a list of jargon. I need to see if we can actually make it work.",
